register usage and the Nicla Vision chip selects follow the public
BrainBoard1500 Arduino library by Neuromorphyx
(https://github.com/Neuromorphyx/BrainBoard1500_arduino_library),
Copyright (c) 2026 Neuromorphyx, MIT License. No code was copied; the
implementation in src/cbb15 is new.

The models and sample inputs in src/cbb15_models are derived from the
BrainChip Dev Hub (https://github.com/Brainchip-Inc/brainchip_devhub),
Copyright 2025 Brainchip Holdings Ltd., Apache License 2.0. The ImageNet
